# main-tema-cathode-tx: the Cathode theme on the transmitting state of
# main-tx-simulado: TX visor, TX info panel, split and the amber active buttons.
# Same radio state as that fixture; the theme is the only variable, so the render
# shows how Cathode separates TX (warm orange-red on tx_bg / tx_box) from the
# sepia/amber RX readings. No audio or RF is generated: the radio state is the
# mock's.

name main-tema-cathode-tx
screen main

theme Cathode
seed 31

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14076000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc fast

split true
att false
pre true
atu true
ant 2

smeter_db -63

battery_v 12.0
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 70
charging false

rxtx tx
